{"chunk":"Where a lot in a business or industrial district abuts a lot in a residential district,\n               the lot in the business or industrial district shall have along each line abutting\n               a residential district a yard equal in width or depth to that required in the residential\n               district. Where land on one side of a street between two intersecting streets is zoned\n               partly as residential and partly as business or industrial, the front yard depth in\n               so much of the business or industrial district as lies within one hundred feet (measured\n               along the street line) from the boundary line dividing the two districts shall be\n               equal to the front yard depth required by this code in the S, R or H district.","document":"ARTICLE_12_-_TRANSITION_ZONING","city":"boston","heading_1":"ARTICLE 12 TRANSITION ZONING","heading_2":"Section 12-3. Lots in Business or Industrial Districts Adjacent to Residential District.","url":"https:\/\/library.municode.com\/MA\/Boston\/codes\/Redevelopment_Authority?nodeId=ART12TRZO_S12-3LOBUINDIADREDI","district_code":[],"district_category":[],"embedding":[0.0267970506,-0.0336162932,0.019117929,0.0365044661,-0.0269585829,0.000620161,0.0246987082,0.014903577,-0.0348231718,0.0104267672,0.0519632399,0.0652286783,0.0241775271,0.0055650938,0.0093350708,0.0357071906,0.0142204715,0.0040783593,-0.0233128481,-0.0094294436,0.0282481778,-0.0110254372,0.0308664888,-0.0408190414,-0.0138136754,-0.0193213932,-0.0220718198,-0.0602595471,0.0125775654,-0.04462846,0.0234181769,0.0015594948,-0.0285236742,-0.0324228406,0.0068175006,-0.0002243065,-0.0127902795,-0.0344652534,-0.0128428265,0.0125757428,-0.000142,0.0452638045,-0.0323503427,0.026755793,0.0088807354,-0.0170815066,0.0139409397,0.0406276993,-0.0279022343,0.025562603,0.0213750042,0.0188929513,-0.0708047971,0.0285718422,-0.0362454243,-0.0668036193,-0.0170222875,-0.0059121158,0.0156965312,-0.0181531347,-0.0210217647,-0.